menu "RuVector benchmark"
config RD_PROFILE_SAMPLES
    int "Maximum percentile samples (0 removes profiling storage)"
    range 0 2048
    default 2048
    help
        Uses 8 bytes per sample. Set 0 for production builds to recover
        16384 bytes of static RAM. Inference, selftest, bench and energy
        remain available. Paired benchmark builds must use equal capacities.
config RD_BENCH_GPIO
    int "Optional energy marker GPIO (-1 disables it)"
    range -1 48
    default -1
    help
        Select a free output GPIO for an external power analyzer. The marker
        brackets only the energy command's inference batch. Validate pin
        availability for the connected board before enabling this option.
config RD_OTA
    bool "Serial OTA updates with A/B slots"
    default y
    help
        Adds the "ota status" and "ota begin" commands on the same UART.
        Requires the two-slot partitions.csv. With bootloader rollback enabled,
        a new image is kept only after its model self-test passes.
endmenu
